    "message": "fix: correct tracked filename case for Button.tsx\n\nGit tracked src/components/ui/button.tsx from the original scaffold while\ndisk held Button.tsx. macOS sets core.ignorecase=true, so every local\ngate — typecheck, lint, tests, build — resolved the import against the\nlowercase file and passed. Vercel builds on Linux, where the checkout\ngenuinely produces button.tsx and `@/components/ui/Button` cannot\nresolve, failing three modules.\n\nA repo-wide scan found this was the only case mismatch.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TVCj9rGjhKeXpXZ9MkVRFX",
